A minimal yet complete CI/CD playground with GitHub Actions.

Real-world workflows including:
- Multi-branch strategy (feature → develop → release → main)
- Testing, linting, and code quality gates
- Docker build & push to GHCR
- Deploy to Vercel / Railway / Alibaba Cloud / Kubernetes
- Automated semantic versioning & changelog
- Failure notifications (Slack / WeChat / Feishu)

Personal learning repo, kept up-to-date for interviews and review.

